SUMMARY:Badminton Party 🎉
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nBadminton\, spring... what more 
 could you want?\n\nWe'll be at Carrier Park. We will be in the greenery ar
 ea past the shelter (not right next to it).\n\nHere's the exact location (
 the same place we ended up last time): https://goo.gl/maps/6xNqAzz78zB5Lsq
 Q7\n\nBring your own food/drinks\, play badminton\, or just come and hang 
 out. We have equipment so no need to bring your own. We wont have chairs o
 r blankets so BYOC and BYOBlanket!\n\nHope to see you there!
