SUMMARY:Trivia Night @ Highland Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nJoin us for Robert’s Totally R
 ad Trivia – pop culture trivia that hits all the good stuff: music\, TV\
 , movies\, video games\, food\, and everything in between.\n\nJoin our cre
 w\, grab a brew\, and put that random knowledge to work. 🧠🍻\n\nIf yo
 u went to our last Highland Trivia event: this is being put on by a differ
 ent group than last time so we're expecting it won't take as long.
